1
00:00:00,434 --> 00:00:02,834
(Howard:)Just try to relax.
We'll be there any minute.

2
00:00:03,243 --> 00:00:04,813
(Howard:)Stuart, stop driving
like an old man.

3
00:00:04,812 --> 00:00:06,312
(Howard:)Speed it up a little.

4
00:00:06,313 --> 00:00:08,043
I'm not an old man!

5
00:00:08,049 --> 00:00:10,219
(Stuart:)I just can't see at night.

6
00:00:11,285 --> 00:00:12,955
(Bernadette:)Here comes another one.

7
00:00:12,953 --> 00:00:15,953
(Bernadette:)Hey, Squinty,
the gas pedal's on the right!

8
00:00:15,956 --> 00:00:17,856
(Stuart:)All right, hang on.

9
00:00:17,858 --> 00:00:20,658
(Stuart:)If you see any pedestrians,
just call 'em out.

10
00:00:24,365 --> 00:00:27,035
(Penny:)Howard and Bernadette's kid
might be born on your birthday.

11
00:00:27,034 --> 00:00:28,364
(Penny:)How cool is that?

12
00:00:28,369 --> 00:00:30,539
Yeah, but I thought this
baby was supposed to ruin

13
00:00:30,538 --> 00:00:32,538
their sex life, not mine.

14
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,240
(Raj:)This is not how

15
00:00:34,241 --> 00:00:37,011
(Raj:)I imagined this day going--
I should be with them right now.

16
00:00:37,011 --> 00:00:39,111
Well, it is
their child.

17
00:00:39,113 --> 00:00:40,343
(Raj:)I know that.

18
00:00:40,347 --> 00:00:42,247
(Raj:)But to be fair,
I've spent nine months

19
00:00:42,249 --> 00:00:44,549
(Raj:)helping Bernadette
get ready for this baby.

20
00:00:44,552 --> 00:00:47,352
(Raj:)And Howard spent five minutes
conceiving it.

21
00:00:47,354 --> 00:00:49,584
(Raj:)And I'm being generous.

22
00:00:50,624 --> 00:00:52,354
(Sheldon:)Five minutes?

23
00:00:52,359 --> 00:00:59,019
(Sheldon:)We must be doing it wrong.
It took us hours.

